# The fixture tenant's deny list, and the shape a real one has: one literal
# term per line, `#` comments skipped. These names are invented for this
# repository's tests and belong to nobody.
#
# A real tenant's list is the OTHER tenants, their clients and their host
# names, it lives on the machine that runs the build, and it is never
# committed anywhere. This copy is tracked only because the thing it names
# is fictional and the checks need something to arm the scan with.
zenith-holdings
quarry-mutual
node77
